      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Could also be nice to add onto the end of a list of languages already used commonly in a group. Like \"English, Deutsch, and Multilingual\". Of course, a little clunky but at least wouldn't make someone feel like anything listed is the only things expected.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-12-02T09:37:51.955Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "As you know, there are so many kinds of groups in VRChat.\n\nSome kinds of group are focusing on domestic/monolingual (such as only Japanese or only English) to communicate smoothly, but there are many international groups, which do not specify any primary language as well.\n\nI would like to propose define \"multilingual\" language tag for group, so that newcomer will not be afraid to join than \"none\", which might imply closed community.\n\n\"Multilingual\" tag will be an appeal point for international community.",
